fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstmessage.html#gst_message_parse_device_monitor_started","fragment":"\n\tgst_message_parse_device_monitor_started\n\n\n\tGst.Message.prototype.parse_device_monitor_started\n\n\n\tGst.Message.parse_device_monitor_started\n\nParses a device-monitor-started message. The device-monitor-started message\nis produced by a GstDeviceMonitor once at least one GstDeviceProvider\nsuccessfully starts probing.\nParameters:\na GstMessage of type GST_MESSAGE_DEVICE_MONITOR_STARTED\nResult location for whether the GstDeviceMonitor was\nsuccessfully started\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nParses a device-monitor-started message. The device-monitor-started message\nis produced by a Gst.DeviceMonitor once at least one Gst.DeviceProvider\nsuccessfully starts probing.\nParameters:\na Gst.Message of type Gst.MessageType.DEVICE_MONITOR_STARTED\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nParses a device-monitor-started message. The device-monitor-started message\nis produced by a Gst.DeviceMonitor once at least one Gst.DeviceProvider\nsuccessfully starts probing.\nParameters:\na Gst.Message of type Gst.MessageType.DEVICE_MONITOR_STARTED\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});